
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ToUpper(Text: string): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llToUpper(string Text);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a string that is <b>src</b> with all upper-case characters.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Text / src</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>string</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">97</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
        <span class="attr-label bg-native">Native Coded</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>The opposite is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlToLower" target="_blank">llToLower</a>.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>There is no Linden Library "llToProperCase", which would return <i><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sentence_case" target="_blank">correctly</a></i> capitalized strings; However, there are user functions that do this: <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/User:Fred_Gandt/Scripts/Functions#ToNormal" target="_blank">ToNormal</a></li>
    <li>The function also works for many characters outside the 7-bit ASCII range, especially latin, cyrillic and greek, but not all characters tagged as "lowercase" in the Unicode specification are converted.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local msg = "I like candy!"
local p = ll.ToUpper(msg)
ll.OwnerSay(p)  --Will say "I LIKE CANDY!"`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string msg = "I like candy!";
string p = llToUpper(msg);
llOwnerSay(p);//Will say "I LIKE CANDY!"`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>See Also</h2>
  <h3>Functions</h3>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>•</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlToLower" target="_blank">llToLower</a></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Signature</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
function string llToUpper( string src );
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</DocsLayout>
      